WEBVTT

00:00:15.230 --> 00:00:16.910
(PANTING)

00:00:20.870 --> 00:00:22.350
(MOANS)

00:00:24.150 --> 00:00:25.830
Sulley!

00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:27.870
Oh, Sulley.

00:00:29.190 --> 00:00:30.790
OK, Sulley, come on.

00:00:31.590 --> 00:00:33.670
Hey! You guys seen Sulley anywhere?

00:00:33.710 --> 00:00:35.790
-Nope, sorry.
-Sulley!

00:00:36.070 --> 00:00:38.790
Boy, Wazowski
looks like he's in trouble.

00:00:40.230 --> 00:00:43.070
2319! We have a 2319!

00:00:43.110 --> 00:00:45.350
Oh, dear.

00:00:46.110 --> 00:00:47.230
Sulley!

00:00:47.510 --> 00:00:48.630
Sulley!

00:00:51.910 --> 00:00:54.230
Sulley. Great news, pal.

00:00:54.470 --> 00:00:56.950
I got us a way out of this mess,
but we gotta hurry.

00:00:57.030 --> 00:00:58.510
Where is it?

00:00:58.590 --> 00:01:00.230
(WHIMPERING)

00:01:00.310 --> 00:01:02.590
Sull, that's a cube of garbage.

00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:04.990
Uh-oh.

00:01:05.070 --> 00:01:07.990
I can still hear her little voice.

00:01:08.270 --> 00:01:10.430
-BOO: Mike Wazowski.
-I can hear it too.

00:01:10.510 --> 00:01:13.270
-BABY MONSTERS: Mike Wazowski!
-How many kids you got in there?

00:01:13.350 --> 00:01:14.910
ALL: Mike Wazowski!

00:01:16.430 --> 00:01:18.110
-Kitty!
-Boo!

00:01:20.070 --> 00:01:23.310
Boo, you're all right.
I was so worried. I was...

00:01:24.110 --> 00:01:27.350
Don't you ever
run away from me again, young lady.

00:01:28.190 --> 00:01:30.830
But I'm so glad you're safe.

00:01:31.270 --> 00:01:33.990
My, what an affectionate father.

00:01:34.150 --> 00:01:36.990
Actually, she's my cousin's sister's...

00:01:37.270 --> 00:01:39.630
-That's enough. Let's go.
-Mike Wazowski.

00:01:39.670 --> 00:01:41.630
Yeah. Step aside, kid.
We're in a...

00:01:41.670 --> 00:01:42.670
(SCREAMING)

00:01:47.470 --> 00:01:49.190
(BABY MONSTERS SCREAMING)

00:01:49.270 --> 00:01:52.630
-Will you stop making Boo laugh?
-I didn't. Come on.

00:01:53.630 --> 00:01:55.910
(ALL CRYING)

00:01:56.350 --> 00:01:58.750
I still don't understand.
You got Boo's door?

00:01:58.790 --> 00:02:00.190
I'll explain later. Run.

00:02:01.110 --> 00:02:04.790
Let's move, let's move. Come on.
Please be there. Please be there.

00:02:05.110 --> 00:02:07.990
-There it is, just like Randall said.
-Randall?

00:02:08.110 --> 00:02:10.470
Wait a minute. Boo, hey.

00:02:10.510 --> 00:02:13.310
MIKE: One, two, three, four,
get the kid through the door.

00:02:13.870 --> 00:02:17.430
-The nightmare is over.
-It's OK, Boo. What's the matter?

00:02:17.510 --> 00:02:19.990
-It's time to move.
-Mike, what are you thinking?

00:02:20.070 --> 00:02:22.830
-Randall's after Boo.
-Who cares? Let's go.

00:02:22.870 --> 00:02:25.870
-This is a limited-time offer.
-No. I don't like this.

00:02:25.950 --> 00:02:28.550
Sulley, you wanted her door
and there it is.

00:02:28.630 --> 00:02:31.110
-Now let's move.
-No, Mike.

00:02:31.830 --> 00:02:33.950
You want me to prove
everything's on the up and up?

00:02:33.990 --> 00:02:35.990
-He wants a door, I get a door.
-Wait.

00:02:36.070 --> 00:02:38.190
Paranoid delusional furball.

00:02:40.350 --> 00:02:41.630
Mike!

00:02:45.830 --> 00:02:47.230
(WHINING)

00:03:20.710 --> 00:03:22.150
(CLANKING)

00:03:29.430 --> 00:03:31.430
(BELL RINGING)

00:03:40.470 --> 00:03:42.910
Hey, Sulley, where you been all day?

00:03:42.990 --> 00:03:44.990
Sulley? Sulley!

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:03.310
Mike? Mike?

00:04:04.270 --> 00:04:05.510
Where are you?

00:04:05.910 --> 00:04:07.270
Are you in there?

00:04:07.830 --> 00:04:09.350
Where are you, buddy?

00:04:09.950 --> 00:04:11.150
Mike?

00:04:11.670 --> 00:04:13.190
Where are you?

00:04:21.870 --> 00:04:23.110
(SPEAKING BABY TALK)

00:04:23.350 --> 00:04:24.790
Boo, way to go.

00:04:32.910 --> 00:04:34.350
It's OK.

00:04:51.310 --> 00:04:52.390
(DISTANT VOICES)

00:04:52.470 --> 00:04:54.350
FUNGUS: Randall, did you have to...

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:07.430
RANDALL: Yes! I got the kid.
FUNGUS: Oh, huzzah!

00:05:07.750 --> 00:05:11.710
-Great news. Not that I was concerned.
-Get over here and help me.

00:05:11.990 --> 00:05:14.630
Come on, while we're young here,
Fungus.

00:05:16.510 --> 00:05:18.630
(BOTH GRUNTING)

00:05:18.670 --> 00:05:20.830
The kid needs to take off a few pounds.

00:05:25.630 --> 00:05:28.670
Wazowski! Where is it,
you little one-eyed cretin?

00:05:28.750 --> 00:05:31.630
It's cretin. If you're gonna
threaten me, do it properly.

00:05:31.830 --> 00:05:34.030
Second, you're nuts if you think
kidnapping me

00:05:34.110 --> 00:05:35.750
is gonna help you cheat!

00:05:35.830 --> 00:05:38.470
(CHUCKLING EVILLY)

00:05:38.510 --> 00:05:41.590
You still think this is about
that stupid scare record?

00:05:41.870 --> 00:05:43.430
Well, I did.

00:05:43.510 --> 00:05:48.350
Right up until you chuckled like that.
Now I think I should get out of here.

00:05:49.030 --> 00:05:52.190
I'm about to revolutionize
the scaring industry.

00:05:52.230 --> 00:05:55.190
When I do,
even the great James P. Sullivan

00:05:55.270 --> 00:05:57.030
is gonna be working for me.

00:05:57.110 --> 00:06:00.230
Well, somebody's certainly
been a busy bee.

00:06:00.310 --> 00:06:03.710
First I need to know where the kid is
and you're gonna tell me.

00:06:03.790 --> 00:06:05.550
-I don't know.
-Sure.

00:06:05.710 --> 00:06:07.710
I don't. I don't.

00:06:07.790 --> 00:06:09.110
Uh-oh.

00:06:10.230 --> 00:06:13.070
MIKE: What's that? Wait.
Wait, wait, wait, wait.

00:06:13.830 --> 00:06:15.870
Come on. No, no.
Come on. Hey, hey.

00:06:15.910 --> 00:06:17.910
Hey, hey. This thing is moving.

00:06:19.470 --> 00:06:22.830
I don't like big moving things
that are moving towards me.

00:06:23.110 --> 00:06:24.550
No. Come on. Hey!

00:06:24.830 --> 00:06:29.510
-Randall!
-Say hello to the scream extractor.

00:06:30.230 --> 00:06:31.350
Hello.

00:06:31.590 --> 00:06:34.590
Where you going?
We'll talk. We'll have a latte.

00:06:34.910 --> 00:06:37.470
Come on. We can talk about this.

00:06:39.070 --> 00:06:40.390
(WHIRRING)

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:43.190
What is that thing?

00:06:43.910 --> 00:06:46.270
Wait, wait, wait.
No, no, no.

00:06:46.310 --> 00:06:48.110
No. Come on.

00:06:48.190 --> 00:06:49.630
(DEEP, RESONATING WHIRRING)

00:06:49.710 --> 00:06:52.430
Help. Help! Help, help!

00:06:59.590 --> 00:07:01.830
For... What did you do wrong this time?

00:07:01.910 --> 00:07:05.190
-I don't know. I calibrated the...
-Go check the machine.

00:07:05.270 --> 00:07:07.390
There must be something wrong
with the scream intake valve.

00:07:09.670 --> 00:07:10.710
Huh?

